{"4821630":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"MarsCity3026","steam_appid":4821630,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a robot that solves puzzles with her grappling hook. Solve mazes and puzzles inspired by games like Tomb Raider, Jedi: Fallen Order, and Portal. Use the grappling hook to navigate, operate mechanisms, and reach new areas. Find your way to the end to complete each puzzle. 1000 years in the future, mars has been settled for centuries. Great cities are home to robots, genetically engineered dogs, and humans. Humans had to go into cryosleep to escape disaster. Solve mechanical puzzles to bring the atmosphere control fans back online so that humans can return to Mars City.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the grappling hook to navigate and get through mazes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821630\/extras\/b3c6b9847b1ff914b1c637a222f8db69.poster.avif?t=1793658310\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821630\/extras\/b3c6b9847b1ff914b1c637a222f8db69.webm?t=1793658310\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821630\/extras\/b3c6b9847b1ff914b1c637a222f8db69.mp4?t=1793658310\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve mechanical puzzles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821630\/extras\/0b74979a143d759306c9f31aa9ccf38a.poster.avif?t=1793658310\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821630\/extras\/0b74979a143d759306c9f31aa9ccf38a.webm?t=1793658310\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821630\/extras\/0b74979a143d759306c9f31aa9ccf38a.mp4?t=1793658310\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello, I am the developer of MarsCity3026. I am a solo developer. This is my time putting a game on steam. I am a first time Dad as of just a day before releasing this game. This is a puzzle game for kids. I did everything the hard way so that I would learn a lot. Few plugins, nothing but my own assets, no AI except the google summary thing (primarily stuck to official unity documentation). Mostly just out of the box blender and unity along with audacity and gimp.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a robot that solves puzzles with her grappling hook. Solve mazes and puzzles inspired by games like Tomb Raider, Jedi: Fallen Order, and Portal. Use the grappling hook to navigate, operate mechanisms, and reach new areas. Find your way to the end to complete each puzzle. 1000 years in the future, mars has been settled for centuries. Great cities are home to robots, genetically engineered dogs, and humans. Humans had to go into cryosleep to escape disaster. Solve mechanical puzzles to bring the atmosphere control fans back online so that humans can return to Mars City.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the grappling hook to navigate and get through mazes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821630\/extras\/b3c6b9847b1ff914b1c637a222f8db69.poster.avif?t=1793658310\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821630\/extras\/b3c6b9847b1ff914b1c637a222f8db69.webm?t=1793658310\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821630\/extras\/b3c6b9847b1ff914b1c637a222f8db69.mp4?t=1793658310\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve mechanical puzzles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821630\/extras\/0b74979a143d759306c9f31aa9ccf38a.poster.avif?t=1793658310\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821630\/extras\/0b74979a143d759306c9f31aa9ccf38a.webm?t=1793658310\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821630\/extras\/0b74979a143d759306c9f31aa9ccf38a.mp4?t=1793658310\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello, I am the developer of MarsCity3026. I am a solo developer. This is my time putting a game on steam. I am a first time Dad as of just a day before releasing this game. This is a puzzle game for kids. I did everything the hard way so that I would learn a lot. Few plugins, nothing but my own assets, no AI except the google summary thing (primarily stuck to official unity documentation). Mostly just out of the box blender and unity along with audacity and gimp.<\/p>","short_description":"A game for kids and adults. Grapple, swing, move mechanical puzzle pieces. Play as a robot that solves mazes and mechanical puzzles. Each puzzle brings the atmosphere control fans back online so that the humans can wake from cryosleep.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821630\/42f884e9b7c096ad5761d692712360912b10b9a6\/header.jpg?t=1793658310","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821630\/16f3b677d780eb2bb34843ec8bb2200b3febe979\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793658310","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821630\/16f3b677d780eb2bb34843ec8bb2200b3febe979\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793658310","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 version 21H1<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 11th Gen Intel© Core™ i7-1165G7 @ 2.80GHz × 4<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel Iris Xe MAX Graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Lesser specs than this may lead to lower frame rates and glitches.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> AMD Ryzen 7 2700 Eight-Core Processor × 8<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA Corporation TU106 [GeForce RTX 2060 SUPER]<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS Monterey 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> probably Intel only but you can try M1 anyway<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> mac equivalent of Intel Iris Xe MAX Graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Lesser specs than this may lead to lower frame rates and glitches.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS Monterey 12 or newer<br><\